#: src/plugins/private-files/plugin.c:14
msgid ""
"Searches your whole home folder for keys, passwords and other secrets that "
"others could read."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/private-files/plugin.c:16
msgid ""
"Home checks the places where programs usually keep secrets. This search goes "
"through your whole home folder and finds private keys, password databases "
"and stored logins wherever they are, for example a key copied to the "
"desktop.\n"
"\n"
"For each one it looks at who besides you can read it, taking every folder on "
"the way into account. A secret only you can read is normal, such as your SSH "
"keys; one others can read is a warning.\n"
"\n"
"It reads only the start of small files to recognise them, never shows their "
"content, and keeps nothing: the list lives on screen only. It needs no "
"password and changes nothing."
msgstr ""

